usage: rebis.materials [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

rebis.materials — Materials Science & Metamaterial Design

positional arguments:
  COMMAND               Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    forge               Forge material from IG tuple or catalog entry
    metamaterial        Run Frobenius metamaterial simulation
    critical            Run critical metamaterial simulation
    alloy               Run ouroboric alloy grain boundary analysis
    nonqubit            Run non-qubit quantum computing paradigm analysis
    sophick             Run Sophick forge
    casimir             Run Casimir cavity ZPE design
    molecule            Resolve molecule to SMILES and compute IG tuple
    status              Show results and reports
    list                List all design tools
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)
    help                Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
